rtificate** (documentId: `cc3df4f3-7134-4ca3-9571-48c0260bfeed`) — Official Travis County document certifying that property taxes for the specified lot are fully paid. → `supplementary-docs/travis-county-tax-certificate/overview.md`\n    60→6. **TIA Determination Worksheet** (documentId: `0dbc90ac-37a5-4a6d-a51f-42b839ecb91b`) — Completed worksheet determining that a traffic impact analysis is not required for the proposed site plan development. → `supplementary-docs/tia-determination-worksheet/overview.md`\n    61→7. **Master Comment Report** (documentId: `ca29fbe6-6361-4580-848e-7807ae462499`) — A comprehensive compilation of city staff review comments requiring updates for a site plan application. → `supplementary-docs/master-comment-report/overview.md`\n    62→8. **Project Review Form** (documentId: `e1c5768d-263b-4500-98ff-f6723ae5876c`) — A completed City of Austin form indicating applicable land development codes and site plan application details for the project. → `supplementary-docs/project-review-form/overview.md`\n    63→9. **Project Location Map** (documentId: `10f3f1b9-e25e-4118-bfe3-08ea287ce738`) — A map displaying the geographical location of the project site relative to surrounding streets and parcels. → `supplementary-docs/project-location-map/overview.md`\n    64→10. **Property Tax Documentation** (documentId: `135639d9-9070-45b5-8b3b-8df3dbb0c795`) — Provides evidence that formal tax certificates have been ordered and confirms zero property taxes are currently due. → `supplementary-docs/property-tax-documentation/overview.md`\n    65→\n    66→## Other Files\n    67→\n    68→- `facts.md` — Surveyed property facts (address, zoning, flood zone, etc.)\n    69→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questio