ning that a traffic impact analysis is not required for the proposed site plan development. → `supplementary-docs/tia-determination-worksheet/overview.md`\n7. **Master Comment Report** (documentId: `ca29fbe6-6361-4580-848e-7807ae462499`) — A comprehensive compilation of city staff review comments requiring updates for a site plan application. → `supplementary-docs/master-comment-report/overview.md`\n8. **Project Review Form** (documentId: `e1c5768d-263b-4500-98ff-f6723ae5876c`) — A completed City of Austin form indicating applicable land development codes and site plan application details for the project. → `supplementary-docs/project-review-form/overview.md`\n9. **Project Location Map** (documentId: `10f3f1b9-e25e-4118-bfe3-08ea287ce738`) — A map displaying the geographical location of the project site relative to surrounding streets and parcels. → `supplementary-docs/project-location-map/overview.md`\n10. **Property Tax Documentation** (documentId: `135639d9-9070-45b5-8b3b-8df3dbb0c795`) — Provides evidence that formal tax certificates have been ordered and confirms zero property taxes are currently due. → `supplementary-docs/property-tax-documentation/overview.md`\n\n## Other Files\n\n- `facts.md` — Surveyed property facts (address, zoning, flood zone, etc.)\n","numLines":69,"startLine":1,"totalLines":69}}}
{"level":30,"time":1778187581313,"pid":122,"hostname":"13276d9b-948","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":4,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DFgKfow9igUF31p1f3b4LB","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Site Plan Facts\n     2→\n     3→# Facts — Valley View Townhomes (SP-2025-0126C)\n     4→**3759 Valley View Road, Austin, TX 78704**\n     5→\n     6→---\n     7→\n     8→## Discrepancies\n     9→\n    10→- **Easement (Greenbelt Access & Use, Instrument 2010070731):** A perpetual, no-build greenbelt easement covering 0.31 acres (13,524 sq ft) of the NE interior of Lot 1 is NOT depicted on the submitted site plan and is NOT in the COA GIS easement layer. County clerk research confirms it is real, recorded, and perpetual. Must be depicted before approval.\n    11→- **Easement (City of Austin Drainage, Instrument 2011021137):** A perpetual City of Austin drainage easement covering 0.130 acres (5,670 sq ft) of the NE corner of Lot 1 is NOT depicted on the submitted site plan and is NOT in the COA GIS easement layer. County clerk research confirms it is real, recorded, and perpetual. Must be depicted before approval.\n    12→- **Combined NE no-build zone (~0.44 ac):** Together, the two easements above encumber approximately 0.44 acres (~19%) of the NE portion of the 2.16-acre site. Neither is shown on submitted plans. Proposed building layout must be evaluated against both easement footprints.\n    13→- **Acreage:** Site plan states 2.16 ac; 2019 deed/survey states 2.158 ac; TCAD states 2.1970 ac; COA GIS parcel measures 2.111 ac (91,944 sq ft). If the controlling acreage is 2.111 ac (GIS), the IC calculation based on 2.16 ac should be rechecked.\n    14→- **10' Wastewater Easement (Vol 73/76, C8S-75-160):** COA GIS shows this plat-dedicated easement running across the parcel. Not confirmed on the submitted site plan. Site plan notes \"must verify no conflicts.\"\n    15→- **25' Drainage Easement and 7.5