{"level":30,"time":1778187589757,"pid":122,"hostname":"13276d9b-948","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":1,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR23TK3HX1REWKM1BVKPXAR4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So from the guides:\n- Sheet 21 (Electrical Design Plan) shows underground electrical lines, transformers, pull boxes (all underground)\n- Sheet 31 (Landscape Plan) shows tree locations, utilities (includes \"Overhead Electric\" mentioned in the key)\n- Sheet 32 (Tree List) shows all surveyed trees\n- Sheet 35 (Landscape Calculations) shows plant schedules with species names\n\nThe fact that Sheet 31 mentions \"Overhead Electric\" in its content blocks suggests there are overhead electric lines shown on the landscape plan.\n\nLet me now read the actual content blocks to get details on:\n1. What overhead electric facilities exist\n2. Where trees are proposed and their species\n3. What distances are shown","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0f3dc44-9163-45e1-9f6b-3d0c261bf982","uuid":"06dbb14b-0557-4fb4-a8bc-a6c14c2cd168"}
