{"level":30,"time":1778187596810,"pid":122,"hostname":"13276d9b-948","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":1,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR23TQPW1PXCSH94HMAZYRBE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! Now I have detailed information. Let me analyze what I've found:\n\n**From Sheet 31 (Landscape Plan) - Block 2:**\n- The site plan shows utility lines including \"overhead electric (OHE)\"\n- Trees are indicated by various symbols on the landscape plan\n\n**From Sheet 21 (Electrical Design Plan) - Block 3:**\n- Shows underground electrical infrastructure (transformers, pull boxes, underground electric lines, electrical meters)\n- No mention of overhead electric infrastructure on the electrical design plan itself\n\n**From Sheet 35 (Landscape Calculations) - Plant List:**\nThe proposed trees are:\n- **Shade Trees:**\n  - Live Oak (Quercus virginiana) - 2 trees, 100 gal., 4\" caliper, 16' height minimum\n  - Cedar Elm (Ulmus crassifolia) - 10 trees, 100 gal., 4\" caliper, 16' height minimum\n- **Ornamental Trees:**\n  - Texas Mountain Laurel (Sophora secundiflora) - 2 trees, 45 gal., 2.5\" caliper, 8' height minimum\n  - Mexican Redbud (Cercis canadensis var. mexicana) - 6 trees, 45 gal., 2.5\" caliper, 10' height minimum\n\n**Shrubs and Groundcovers** are also listed but these are typically not subject to overhead electric line clearances.\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Determine if overhead electric lines are actually present on the property\n2. Check if the proposed trees comply with the clearance requirements\n3. Check if the plant legend identifies species\n4. Check if large trees are differentiated\n\nSince Sheet 31 mentions \"overhead electric (OHE)\" on the landscape plan, I need to use vision to see exactly what's shown and where the overhead electric lines are located relative to the proposed trees.\n\nLet me call vision to examine Sheet 31 more carefully to understand the overhead electric infrastructure and tree locations.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0f3dc44-9163-45e1-9f6b-3d0c261bf982","uuid":"0c6210d9-5cb1-4a51-b277-4392c6d729d5"}
