{"level":30,"time":1778187618167,"pid":122,"hostname":"13276d9b-948","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":5,"runIndex":"run-2","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":21,"prompt":"Examine the electrical plan sheet and identify: 1) Location and count of transformer pads on the site, 2) Dimensions shown for any transformer pads (width x length), 3) Labeled clearances from transformer pads to buildings, structures, parking, fences, utilities, or other site features, 4) Any reference to transformer specifications (single-phase, three-phase, oil-filled vs dry-type), 5) Any easements labeled around transformer locations, 6) Any notes about transformers on this sheet. Focus on exact measurements, locations relative to buildings, and any callouts or specifications related to transformer installations.","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a visual analysis of the provided Preliminary Electrical Design Plan sheet, here is the information requested regarding transformer pads:\n\n**1) Location and count of transformer pads on the site:**\nThere are **5** locations labeled exactly as \"**Electrical Transformer Pad**\" on this sheet. Their approximate locations are:\n*   **Pad 1:** Located in the northwest corner of the site, west of Bldg. 1.\n*   **Pad 2:** Located on the western edge of the site, west of Bldg. 2.\n*   **Pad 3:** Located on the eastern side of the site, east of Bldg. 4.\n*   **Pad 4:** Located in the southwest corner of the site, west of Bldg. 8.\n*   **Pad 5:** Located in the south-central area of the site, south of Bldg. 7.\n\n**2) Dimensions shown for any transformer pads (width x length):**\nThere are **no specific dimensions** (width x length) labeled for any of the transformer pads. They are graphically represented by dashed rectangular outlines, but numerical measurements are not provided on this sheet.\n\n**3) Labeled clearances from transformer pads to buildings, structures, parking, fences, utilities, or other site features:**\nThere are **no explicitly labeled clearance dimensions** (e.g., \"5'\", \"10'\") from the transformer pads to nearby buildings, sidewalks, or property lines on this sheet. While the pads are shown graphically near sidewalks and buildings, exact setback distances are not called out.\n\n**4) Any reference to transformer specifications (single-phase, three-phase, oil-filled vs dry-type):**\nThere are **no specifications** regarding phase, capacity, or type of transformer noted on this sheet. The only identifying text is the label \"**Electrical Transformer Pad**\".\n\n**5) Any easements labeled around transformer locations:**\nMost pads do not have dedicated transformer easements explicitly labeled around their specific footprints. However, one notable related easement is:\n*   Near the southwest transformer pad (west of Bldg. 8), there is a label for a \"**Vault Easement**\" that points to a dashed rectangular area encompassing the \"Electrical Transformer Pad\", \"Electrical Pull Box\", and \"Electrical Meters\" at that location.\n*   Additionally, general utility easements (such as \"10' P.U.E.\") are shown around the perimeter of the site, which some of the electrical infrastructure routes through or sits adjacent to.\n\n**6) Any notes about transformers on this sheet:**\nThere are **no specific textual notes** in the \"Utility Notes\" section or elsewhere on the sheet detailing installation, requirements, or specifications for the transformers. The only text referencing them are the five map callout labels stating \"**Electrical Transformer Pad**\".","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1439,"outputTokens":586,"totalTokens":4301,"reasoningTokens":2276},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 2092056]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset