{"level":30,"time":1778187626862,"pid":122,"hostname":"13276d9b-948","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":2,"runIndex":"run-1","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen_01KR23VNW9WEZR2S1JZNZCPP3S","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I now have a clear picture. The electrical plan shows 4 transformer pads on the site:\n1. West side, near Bldg 1 & 2\n2. Southwest side, near Bldg 8 (with a Vault Easement shown)\n3. East central side, near Bldg 5 & 6 (with bollards shown)\n4. Southeast side, near Bldg 7 (with bollards shown)\n\nHowever, the vision tool reveals that the plans lack specific design details:\n- No dimensions for the transformer pads themselves\n- No clearance measurements to adjacent features\n- No transformer type specifications (oil-filled vs dry-type, single-phase vs three-phase)\n- No detailed specifications for bollards or other protective equipment\n\nNow I need to conduct a thorough research phase to examine all relevant documents and sheets mentioned in the grouping's \"Documents to Review\" section:\n- Site Plan Sheets (Sheet 9)\n- Electrical Plan Sheets (Sheet 21 - already reviewed)\n- Utility Plan Sheets (Sheet 19)\n- Landscape Plan Sheets (Sheet 31)\n- Detail Sheets (need to check what details are available)\n- Easement Exhibits (Sheet 2)\n- Building Elevation Sheets\n- Cross-Section Drawings\n- Grading and Drainage Plans (Sheets 11, 12)\n- Architectural Specifications\n- Austin Energy Design Approval Documents\n\nLet me start by examining the site plan, utility plan, landscape plan, and other relevant sheets to gather comprehensive evidence before evaluating each checklist item.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a136e13c-2680-4375-811f-a5416413e77d","uuid":"b2d365bd-ce32-48c4-8cc2-ee73d34ba7ce"}
