inework labeling **\"-OHE-\"** denoting the existing lines outside the immediate construction footprint.\n\n**Specific Observations about the Layout:**\nThe electrical design utilizes a loop or branching system originating from the western boundary (connecting near the \"Underground Electric Line\" label). The underground conduit (blue lines) runs alongside the internal driveways. The \"Electrical Transformer Pads\" are strategically placed in open/landscape areas adjacent to the pavement. From the transformers or main conduit lines, connections are routed through \"Electrical Pull Boxes\" and terminate at \"Electrical Meters\" banked on the side elevations of the townhome buildings.","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":170901.18098,"endTime":199391.413474,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"WP38adD3Af3JsbwPvPym2AI"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.033385","marketCost":"0.033385","inferenceCost":"0.03316","inputInferenceCost":"0.002812","outputInferenceCost":"0.030348","reportingTagWriteCost":"0.000225","generationId":"gen_01KR23V7QF9B8B30NC731Z5VBX"}}}]},"ms