6'\" and appears to be situated within or adjacent to a **\"5' ELEC. EASEMENT (VOL. 4381, PG. 74 P.R.T.C.TX)\"**.\n    *   This line extends back and connects to another power pole (**\"P.P.\"**) located past the middle of the property, near the existing house structure.\n\n3.  **Near the Western Boundary (Bottom side of plan):**\n    *   An overhead utility line marked **\"- O.H.U.L. -\"** cuts diagonally across the North-West corner of the property (bottom-left area of the drawing). It crosses inside the property line labeled \"N63°30'57\"W 414.24'\".\n\n4.  **Near the South-West Corner (Bottom-Right area of plan):**\n    *   Another power pole (**\"P.P.\"**) is located near the South-West corner of the property, adjacent to another **\"5' ELEC. EASEMENT\"** shown in that corner area.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1389,"outputTokens":573,"totalTokens":5638,"reasoningTokens":3676},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 1695804]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-by-character.\n\nCRITICAL: Do not paraphrase, interpret, or \"fill in\" text. If you cannot read something clearly, state \"text unclear\" rather than guessing. Transcribe field labels and values exactly as written.\n\nIf the requirements being validated require certain content to be present, look closely for it and provide all relevant information that pertains to the broader request. Remember that you are only looking at a single supplementary document, or a single page from the primary site plan. Just because you do not find evidence for a requirement on this page does not mean it will not