{"level":30,"time":1778187642573,"pid":122,"hostname":"13276d9b-948","step":"review-runs","item":"1.md","index":6,"runIndex":"run-2","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":4,"prompt":"Examine this existing conditions survey carefully. Are there any overhead utility poles (marked as \"UTILITY POLE\" or shown as vertical line symbols) visible on or immediately adjacent to the property boundaries? Are there any overhead utility lines (marked as \"O.H.U.L.\" or shown as lines with poles) depicted crossing the property or along the property edges, particularly along Valley View Road to the west or along adjacent properties? Please identify the specific locations and directions of any overhead infrastructure you can see, paying particular attention to poles near property corners or along street frontage. If no overhead poles or lines are visible, please state that clearly.","res":{"steps":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a careful examination of the provided Existing Conditions Survey, overhead utility poles and lines are indeed visible. According to the legend, these are denoted by a specific pole symbol (a circle with a crosshair) and lines marked with \"**- OH -**\" for overhead utility lines.\n\nHere are the specific locations and directions of the visible overhead infrastructure:\n\n*   **Southern Boundary:** There is an overhead utility line (marked \"**- OH -**\") running generally parallel to the southern property line (labeled `N63°50'57\"W 414.24'`). This line connects a **UTILITY POLE** located near the southwest corner of the property (which is also adjacent to Valley View Road and features a marked **GUY** wire) to another **UTILITY POLE** situated near the southeast corner of the property.\n*   **Eastern Boundary:** From the **UTILITY POLE** near the southeast corner, the \"**- OH -**\" line continues northward, running generally parallel to the eastern property boundary (labeled `S27°19'28\"W 146.15'`). It connects to a **UTILITY POLE** near the northeast corner, which also has a marked **GUY** wire extending from it.\n*   **Northern Boundary:** An \"**- OH -**\" line runs generally parallel to the northern property boundary (labeled `S63°03'28\"E 419.98'`). It originates from the northeast corner **UTILITY POLE**, passes through another **UTILITY POLE** located roughly midway along the northern line, and continues westward to terminate at a **UTILITY POLE** near the northwest corner of the property, adjacent to Valley View Road.\n*   **Valley View Road Frontage (West):** While there are utility poles positioned near both the northwest and southwest corners of the property adjacent to Valley View Road, there is **no continuous overhead utility line (\"- OH -\") depicted running parallel along the Valley View Road frontage** to connect these two poles. The overhead infrastructure appears to route around the North, East, and South boundaries of the site.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1441,"outputTokens":455,"totalTokens":5383,"reasoningTokens":3487},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 1695804]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-by-character.\n\nCRITICAL: Do not paraphrase, interpret, or \"fill in\" text. If you cannot read something clearly, state \"text unclear\" rather than guessing. Transcribe field labels and values exactly as written.\n\nIf the requirements being validated require certain content to be present, look closely for it and provide all relevant information that pertains to the broader request. Remember that you are only looking at a single supplementary document, or a single page from the primary site plan. Just because you do not find evidence for a requirement on this page does not mean it will not be present on another page.\n\nReport back precisely on what you see, using exact quotes for any text you transcribe from forms, tables, or labels.\n\nThe final review agent will not be able to look at this document directly, so you must be their eyes. Ensure you describe everything relevant in full detail with perfect accuracy.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Examine this existing conditions survey carefully. Are there any overhead utility poles (marked as \"UTILITY POLE\" or shown as vertical line symbols) visible on or immediately adjacent to the property boundaries? Are there any overhead utility lines (marked as \"O.H.U.L.\" or shown as lines with poles) depicted crossing the property or along the property edges, particularly along Valley View Road to the west or along adjacent properties? Please identify the specific locations and directions of any overhead infrastructure you can see, paying particular attention to poles near property corners or along street frontage. If no overhead poles or lines are visible, please state that clearly."}]}],"providerOptions":{"gateway":{"user":"790d4c46-cd86-49b4-a255-a4397ca7ac09","tags":["label:VISION_CHECK_REVIEW_EL_MD_EXP_BASELINE_V3","tool:vision"]}},"headers":{"user-agent":"ai/5.0.152"}}},"response":{"id":"aitxt-zJJNAp96z6nIbCpD40935QWz","timestamp":{},"modelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","headers":{"access-control-allow-headers":"Content-Type, Authorization, ai-gateway-auth-method, ai-gateway-protocol-version, ai-model-id, ai-language-model-id, ai-language-model-specification-version, ai-image-model-specification-version, ai-embedding-model-specification-version, ai-language-model-streaming, ai-reporting-tags, ai-reporting-user, http-referer, x-title, anthropic-beta","access-control-allow-methods":"GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, OPTIONS","access-control-allow-origin":"