ovements:**\n   - 8 buildings with driveways, parking, landscaping\n   - Proposed trees: Live Oak, Cedar Elm, Texas Mountain Laurel, Mexican Redbud\n   - Retaining walls up to 14 feet high\n   - Various site utilities\n\n3. **Gaps/Deficiencies found:**\n   - **NO clearance documentation** from overhead lines to buildings, driveways, parking areas\n   - **NO profile/section views** showing vertical clearances from overhead conductors to buildings\n   - **Trees placed near OHE line without utility-compatible species verification**\n   - **NO 48-hour notification note** on plans\n   - **Unclear if any transmission lines exist** (guide mentioned transmission requirements but I haven't confirmed transmission infrastructure on site)\n   - **NO surveyed conductor elevation data** on building elevations\n   - **NO clearance dimensions** labeled on plan or sections\n\nNow I'm systematically working through the checklist items to assess applicability and compliance status. For items clearly applicable—buildings and structures with overhead electric facilities present—I need clearance documentation across all building features, fences, and retaining walls. The survey of pole locations and mid-span clearances wasn't provided, trees near the lines lack species verification, and the required 48-hour notification note is missing from the plans. Some items may not apply to this specific project, while others can't be verified from the available documentation.","signature":""}],"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f0048680-e5a3-4ca8-8dfa-cc37e7cbf9e3","uuid":"5e3b931b-7ce7-43a4-b4a9-c720e17b38e1"}
