, annotations, callouts, or text notes anywhere along the southern boundary that indicate horizontal or vertical clearance requirements between the planted mitigation trees (\"M\") and the overhead electric line (\"- OHE -\").\n\n**5) Relationship between the trees and Valley View Road at the southern boundary:**\nThe text \"Valley View Road\" is located along the far left (western) edge of the site plan, indicating the road runs North-South. The southern boundary meets Valley View Road at the site's southwest corner. The row of \"M\" designated trees situated under the \"- OHE -\" line begins near this southwest corner and runs eastward along the southern property line, moving away from Valley View Road in a perpendicular orientation to the street."}]}
