{"level":30,"time":1778187878323,"pid":122,"hostname":"13276d9b-948","step":"review-runs","item":"2.md","index":7,"runIndex":"run-3","documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":35,"prompt":"Extract the complete plant schedules shown on this sheet, including: (1) Shade Trees schedule - list all shade tree species proposed, quantities, and planting specifications; (2) Ornamental Trees schedule - list all ornamental tree species proposed, quantities, and specifications; (3) Shrubs schedule - list shrub species, quantities, and maximum spacing. For trees specifically, include the species name, quantity, and container/caliper specifications. Format as a clear, readable table or list.","msg":"Calling vision tool: 1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777 (35)"}
