aries","severity":2,"confidence":1,"crossDep":"Austin Energy — voltage classification confirmation required","attn":"Obtain from Austin Energy or the electrical utility the voltage classification for all existing overhead electric lines on or adjacent to the property. If transmission-class (≥60 kV), verify 50-foot clearance; if distribution (<60 kV), verify appropriate distribution clearances per UCM § 1.10.10.4.","details":[{"text":"Voltage classification of overhead electric lines is not specified on plans (Sheets 21, 31). Cannot determine if transmission (≥60 kV) or distribution (<60 kV) classification applies to verify 50-foot transmission clearance compliance.","citation":"UCM § 1.10.10.4","sourceId":"2:EL-2.2","confidence":1,"runComments":[{"runNum":1,"status":"nv","comment":"Voltage classification of existing overhead electric lines not specified on plans. Cannot determine if transmission (≥60kV) or distribution (<60kV) classification applies, and therefore cannot verify compliance with 50-foot transmission clearance requirement."}]},{"text":"Voltage classification not specified on plans. Cannot independently verify transmission clearance compliance without confirmation that the overhead electric line is transmission-class (≥60 kV).","citation":"UCM § 1.10.10.4","sourceId":"2:EL-2.4","confidence":1,"runComments":[{"runNum":1,"status":"nv","comment":"Voltage classification not specified. Cannot independently verify transmission clearance compliance without confirmation that OHE is transmission-class (≥60kV)."}]}]}]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"4005f938-e42c-4d85-860b-6f25f5ea7bba"}
